summary: Provision a system for testing

description: |
    Provide the guests on which tests will run, for example a virtual
    machine, a container or an existing host. See the
    :ref:`/plugins/provision` documentation for available methods,
    hardware requirements and supported options.

example: |
    # Provision a local virtual machine with the latest Fedora
    provision:
        how: virtual
        image: fedora

link:
    - implemented-by: /tmt/steps/provision
